 repo's changes

-Accommodate:
 -4/23/26: kbuild/gradle: Dynamically anchor to and ascertain build from origin
 -6/28/26: build: Extend 'merge-base' to ksud for use in KSU_VER_CODE (manager)
 -8/10/26: 'ksud: Add boot image LKM injection' (upstream: ksu: f5a3b5a)
(cherry picked from commit 2b90ae3de1c964a6f43a929c75aa98c6fbc54818)
